02:000017C4 6100EC76        	   512:     BSR     TRACE_MARK
02:000017C8 301F            	   513:     MOVE.W  (A7)+,D0
02:000017CA 4ED0            	   514:     JMP     (A0)            ; jump to target (does not return through BSR)
